# Toggle Star from the edit-mode command menu on a Starred entry keeps it in the view while it is edited, and it leaves once editing ends (D-105).
file <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
	- Email @star
END
keys gS <Enter>
type /toggle star
keys <Enter>
see Report
status EDIT
keys <Esc>
hide Report
status NAVIGATE
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Email @star
END
